,\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Kesar poisons Pratigya's food\",\"overview\":\"Kartik takes Komal and Chinky to his house. Krishna and Pratigya show Kartik the wedding album. Kartik tells them that the woman Pratigya identified as Sumitra is the pandit's wife.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Shakti sets another trap\",\"overview\":\"Pratigya wishes to go and enquire about the pandit's wife. Shakti pours oil on the railing at the terrace to make Pratigya fall. Does she fall?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Sumitra can't recall anything\",\"overview\":\"Pratigya and Krishna are shocked to see Sumitra in the pandit's house. While playing on the terrace, Samar slips due to the trap set by Shakti. Shakti takes him to the hospital. What happens to him?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Samar's health improves\",\"overview\":\"The pandit claims that Sumitra is his wife and asks Krishna and Pratigya to leave. Shakti feels terrible for his misdeeds. Will he repent?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Pratigya talks about Sumitra\",\"overview\":\"Krishna faces the wrath of the villagers for tearing Sumitra's dress to expose the burn mark. Shakti apologises to Samar. Sajjan is shocked to realize that Sumitra is alive.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Family goes to see Sumitra\",\"overview\":\"Sensing more interference from Sumitra's family, the pandit plans to move away from the village. Sajjan shows family photos to Sumitra but she doesn't recognize any of them. What will happen next?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-10-19\",\"runtime\":0},